# MCP Server API Keys
#
# Copy this file to .env.mcp and fill in your keys.
# Claude Code expands ${VAR} references in .mcp.json from your shell environment.
#
# To auto-load these vars, add to your ~/.zshrc (or ~/.bashrc):
#   export $(grep -v '^#' /path/to/cc/.env.mcp | xargs)
#
# Or use direnv (https://direnv.net):
#   echo 'dotenv .env.mcp' > .envrc && direnv allow

